tion\": \"Nanchang\", \"error_type\": \"word_choice\", \"explanation\": \"江西省省会是南昌（Nanchang），Nancheng 是江西另一个县名，但文中语境明显指省会城市，属地名误用\"}, {\"original\": \"getting the spicy fried rice\", \"correction\": \"ordering the spicy fried rice\", \"error_type\": \"word_choice\", \"explanation\": \"在餐厅点餐场景中，\'getting\' 太宽泛（可能指‘拿到’或‘正在吃’），而 \'ordering\' 准确表达‘点单’这一动作，更符合上下文逻辑\"}, {\"original\": \"have you tried any other local Jiangxi dishes before?\", \"correction\": \"have you tried any other local Jiangxi dishes?\", \"error_type\": \"word_order\", \"explanation\": \"现在完成时与 \'before\' 连用时，若 \'before\' 作副词表‘之前’且无具体时间参照（如 \'before that\' 或 \'before lunch\'），通常冗余；此处语义已隐含‘过去经历’，删去更自然简洁\"}], \"suggestions\": [\"专有名词（如公司名、地名）要查证官方拼写，避免音近误写（如 ByteDance ≠ BiteDance）\", \"描述点餐动作时，优先用 order（点单）、try（尝试）、taste（品尝）等精准动词，少用 get 这类多义词\", \"现在完成时中，unless 有明确时间对比（如 \'before the trip\'），一般不加 before，直接用 \'Have you ever…?\' 或 \'Have you… yet?\' 更地道\", \"适当使用破折号、冒号或连接词（如 \'or even…\'）能让句子更生动自然，避免机械罗列\"], \"corrected_text\": \"I\'m Doubao, developed by ByteDance. I don\'t have a physical hometown, but I\'m here to chat about anything—like the food in Nanchang or your day. Since you\'re ordering the spicy fried rice, have you tried any other local Jiangxi dishes before?\", \"polished_version\": \"Hi, I\'m Doubao, created by ByteDance. I don’t have a hometown—I’m digital! But I’d love to chat with you about anything: the delicious food in Nanchang, how your day’s going, or even that spicy fried rice you just ordered. Have you sampled any other tasty Jiangxi dishes yet?\"}','2026-06-26 16:16:47'),(59,53,1,'Hey Doubao — great to meet you! It’s cool that you’re built by ByteDance and love chatting about food and places like Nancheng. Since you mentioned spicy fried rice, have you ever tried *Lao Gan Ma* stir-fries or *Jiangxi steamed fish with chili*? Those dishes really pack a punch!','assistant',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-26 16:16:51'),(60,53,2,'고맙습니다','user',NULL,'{\"wpm\": {\"max\": 25, \"label\": \"