"], \"corrected_text\": \"I went to the store yesterday and bought some apples.\", \"polished_version\": \"I popped into the store yesterday and picked up some apples.\"}','2026-07-02 09:03:40'),(187,117,1,'Nice try! Just a small correction: *“I went to the store yesterday and bought some apples.”*  \nWould you like to tell me more — like what kind of apples you like, or why you went to the store? 😊','assistant',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-02 09:03:42'),(188,118,1,'I go to the store yesterday and buy some apple.','user',NULL,'{\"wpm\": {\"max\": 25, \"label\": \"语速\", \"score\": 12, \"value\": 244.4, \"detail\": \"244 词/分钟\"}, \"overall\": 52, \"repetition\": {\"max\": 20, \"rate\": 0.0, \"label\": \"表达流畅度\", \"score\": 20, \"detail\": \"重复率 0%\"}, \"pause_frequency\": {\"max\": 20, \"label\": \"停顿控制\", \"score\": 20, \"detail\": \"停顿 0 次 (0.0次/分钟)\", \"pause_count\": 0, \"pauses_per_min\": 0.0}}',NULL,'{\"errors\": [{\"original\": \"go\", \"correction\": \"went\", \"error_type\": \"tense\", \"explanation\": \"句子描述的是昨天发生的事，必须用一般过去时；go 是不规则动词，过去式是 went，不是 go 或 goed。\"}, {\"original\": \"buy\", \"correction\": \"bought\", \"error_type\": \"tense\", \"explanation\": \"并列动词需保持时态一致；前一个动词用了过去式 went，buy 也必须用过去式 bought。\"}, {\"original\": \"apple\", \"correction\": \"apples\", \"error_type\": \"plural\", \"explanation\": \"apple 是可数名词，前面有 some（表示‘一些’），必须用复数形式 apples；单数 apple 表示‘一个苹果’或泛指种类，不符合语境。\"}], \"suggestions\": [\"记住常见不规则动词的过去式（如 go→went, buy→bought），不要按规则加 -ed。\", \"注意并列动词（and 连接的两个动作）必须时态一致。\", \"some 后面接可数名词时，名词一定要用复数；接不可数名词时用单数（如 some water）。\", \"多积累日常短语动词，比如 pop into（顺便进入）、pick up（顺便买），让表达更自然地道。\"], \"corrected_text\": \"I went to the store yesterday and bought some apples.\", \"polished_version\": \"I popped into the store yesterday and picked up some apples.\"}','2026-07-02 09:06:57'),(189,118,2,'have went to the park and play football.','user',NULL,'{\"wpm\": {\"max\": 25, \"label\": \"语速\", \"score\": 11, \"value\": 272.0, \"detail\": \"272 词/分钟\"}, \"overall\": 51, \"repetition\": {\"max\": 20, \"rate\": 0.0, \"label\": \"表达流畅度\", \"score\": 20, \"detail\": \"重复率 0%\"}, \"pause_frequency\": {\"max\": 20, \"label\": \"停顿控制\", \"score\": 20, \"detail\": \"停顿 0 次 (0.0次/分钟)\", \"pause_count\": 0, \"pauses_per_min\": 0.0}}',NULL,'{\"errors\": [{\"original\": \"have went\", \"correction\": \"have gone\", \"error_type\": \"tense\", \"explanation\": \"‘have’ 是现在完成时的助动词，后面必须接过去分词；‘went’ 是过去式，正确过去分词是 ‘gone’\"}, {\"original\": \"play football\", \"correction\": \"played football\", \"error_type\": \"tense\", \"explanation\": \"并列动词需保持时态一致：前面用了现在完成时（have gone），后面也应用过去分词 ‘played’，构成 ‘have + 过去分词 + and + 过去分词’ 结构\"}, {\"original\": \"have went to the park and play football\", \"correction\": \"I have gone to the park and played football.\", \"error_type\": \"subject_verb_agreement\", \"explanation\": \"句子缺少主语。英语中不能省略主语（尤其在陈述句中），必须加上 ‘I’ 才符合语法规范\"}], \"suggestions\": [\"记住不规则动词的三种形式（原形、过去式、过去分词），比如 go → went → gone\", \"现在完成时（have/has + 过去分词）不能单独使用，一定要有明确主语，如 I, she, we 等\", \"并列动词在复合谓语中必须形式统一：若用 have done，后面所有动词都用过去分词\", \"日常表达中，‘I’ve been to…’ 比 ‘I have gone to…’ 更自然，因为 ‘gone’ 暗示人还在那里，而 ‘been’ 表示已回来\"], \"corrected_text\": \"I have gone to the park and played football.\", \"polished_version\": \"I’ve been to the park and played football a few times.\"}','2026-07-02 09:06:59'),(190,118,2,'Nice try! Just a small correction: *“I went to the store yesterday and bought some apples.”*  \nWould you like to tell me what kind of apples you like—or maybe what else you usually buy at the store? 😊','assistant',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-02 09:06:59'),(191,118,2,'Thanks for sharing! Just a quick note — we usually say *“I went to the store yesterday and bought some apples”* (since it’s past tense, both verbs need to be in the past). And *“I’ve been to the park and played football”* sounds more natural for present perfect. 😊  \nWould you like to tell me what kind of apples you bought — or what you enjoy most about playing football?','assistan