"}, \"pause_frequency\": {\"max\": 20, \"label\": \"停顿控制\", \"score\": 20, \"detail\": \"停顿 0 次 (0.0次/分钟)\", \"pause_count\": 0, \"pauses_per_min\": 0.0}}',NULL,'{\"errors\": [{\"original\": \"一用不平的就为那些大嫂子人是一样的\", \"correction\": \"这个主要的方法是，对那些大嫂子而言，都是一样的\", \"error_type\": \"word_order|word_choice|other\", \"explanation\": \"原句语序混乱、用词不当（如‘一用不平的就为’无语法依据），‘大嫂子人’冗余且不自然；应改为符合汉语表达习惯的主谓宾结构，使用‘对……而言’等恰当介词结构\"}]}','2026-07-03 10:49:49'),(326,176,4,'I’m not quite sure I follow — could you rephrase that? For example, are you describing a strategy, a tool, or a way of helping people? I’d be happy to help clarify or discuss it further!','assistant',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-03 10:49:55'),(327,176,5,'1922 八年了','user',NULL,'{\"wpm\": {\"max\": 25, \"label\": \"语速\", \"score\": 4, \"value\": 745.3, \"detail\": \"745 词/分钟\"}, \"overall\": 44, \"repetition\": {\"max\": 20, \"rate\": 0.0, \"label\": \"表达流畅度\", \"score\": 20, \"detail\": \"重复率 0%\"}, \"pause_frequency\": {\"max\": 20, \"label\": \"停顿控制\", \"score\": 20, \"detail\": \"停顿 0 次 (0.0次/分钟)\", \"pause_count\": 0, \"pauses_per_min\": 0.0}}',NULL,'{\"errors\": []}','2026-07-03 10:50:18'),(328,176,5,'Ah, 1922 — that’s over a century ago! Do you mean something started in 1922 and lasted eight years? Or is “eight years” referring to a different time frame? I’d love to understand the connection.','assistant',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-03 10:50:25'),(329,176,6,'Thank you very much.','user',NULL,'{\"wpm\": {\"max\": 25, \"label\": \"语速\", \"score\": 15, \"value\": 201.2, \"detail\": \"201 词/分钟\"}, \"overall\": 55, \"repetition\": {\"max\": 20, \"rate\": 0.0, \"label\": \"表达流畅度\", \"score\": 20, \"detail\": \"重复率 0%\"}, \"pause_frequency\": {\"max\": 20, \"label\": \"停顿控制\", \"score\": 20, \"detail\": \"停顿 0 次 (0.0次/分钟)\", \"pause_count\": 0, \"pauses_per_min\": 0.0}}',NULL,'{\"errors\": []}','2026-07-03 10:50:48'),(330,176,6,'You\'re very welcome! 😊  \nIt was a pleasure chatting with you — and I’m always happy to help with English practice or just a friendly conversation. Let me know if you\'d like to try another self-introduction, or explore a topic you enjoy!','assistant',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-03 10:50:55'),(331,176,7,'然後你來試一下','user',NULL,'{\"wpm\": {\"max\": 25, \"label\": \"语速\", \"score\": 18, \"value\": 70.2, \"detail\": \"70 词/分钟\"}, \"overall\": 58, \"repetition\": {\"max\": 20, \"rate\": 0.0, \"label\": \"表达流畅度\", \"score\": 20, \"detail\": \"重复率 0%\"}, \"pause_frequency\": {\"max\": 20, \"label\": \"停顿控制\", \"score\": 20, \"detail\": \"停顿 0 次 (0.0次/分钟)\", \"pause_count\": 0, \"pauses_per_min\": 0.0}}',NULL,'{\"errors\": []}','2026-07-03 10:51:23'),(332,176,7,'Sure! Here’s a simple, friendly self-introduction you could use — feel free to adapt it or ask me to tweak it:  \n\n“Hi, I’m Alex. I work as an English conversation partner, and I love helping people speak more confidently. In my free time, I enjoy hiking, trying new cafés, and learning little bits of different languages.”  \n\nWant to try your own version? I’ll listen carefully and give gentle, helpful feedback! 🌟','assistant',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-03 10:51:30'),(333,176,8,'明年喔','user',NULL,'{\"wpm\": {\"max\": 25, \"label\": \"语速\", \"score\": 5, \"value\": 19.2, \"detail\": \"19 词/分钟\"}, \"overall\": 45, \"repetition\": {\"max\": 20, \"rate\": 0.0, \"label\": \"表达流畅度\", \"score\": 20, \"detail\": \"重复率 0%\"}, \"pause_frequency\": {\"max\": 20, \"label\": \"停顿控制\", \"score\": 20, \"detail\": \"停顿 0 次 (0.0次/分钟)\", \"pause_count\": 0, \"pauses_per_min\": 0.0}}',NULL,'{\"errors\": []}','2026-07-03 10:52:10'),(334,176,8,'Ah, “next year” — exciting! 🌟  \nAre you planning something special for next year? Maybe a goal, a trip, or a new habit you’d like to start? I’d love to hear about it!','assistant',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-03 10:52:17');
