学会在回答对方问题的同时进行互动。建议先简要回答AI的问题（如名字），然后再提出你的问题，这样对话才能自然流畅地进行。','completed','2026-06-26 14:04:27','2026-06-26 14:05:46','2026-06-26 14:04:27','2026-06-26 14:05:46'),(24,4,'95fc81e2b694','self_intro',NULL,'B1',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','2026-06-26 14:09:03',NULL,'2026-06-26 14:09:03',NULL),(25,4,'5a9bd1561d99','self_intro',NULL,'B1',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','2026-06-26 14:09:18',NULL,'2026-06-26 14:09:18',NULL),(26,11,'325d9a69389d','self_intro',NULL,'B1',2,54.80,85.00,70.00,40.00,60.00,'请注意倾听对方的问题或指令，先完成当前的交际任务（如自我介绍），然后再自然地反问对方，以保持对话的连贯性。','completed','2026-06-26 14:09:53','2026-06-26 14:10:25','2026-06-26 14:09:53','2026-06-26 14:10:25'),(27,11,'8793c137a315','self_intro',NULL,'B1',0,NULL,0.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,'你还没有开口说话，无法评估你的口语水平。再来一次试试吧！','completed','2026-06-26 14:15:23','2026-06-26 14:15:28','2026-06-26 14:15:23','2026-06-26 14:15:28'),(28,11,'d1203765f134','self_intro',NULL,'B1',3,63.00,75.00,70.00,85.00,70.00,'下次请先完整回答对方的问题（如‘My name is… I’m from…’），避免切换语言或反问相同问题；可准备3–4个B1级自我介绍关键词（e.g., ‘I live in…’, ‘I work as…’, ‘I like…’）增强连贯表达。','completed','2026-06-26 14:15:30','2026-06-26 14:16:21','2026-06-26 14:15:30','2026-06-26 14:16:21'),(29,11,'fe73d57872e7','self_intro',NULL,'B1',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','2026-06-26 14:28:35',NULL,'2026-06-26 14:28:35',NULL),(30,11,'34262482be9b','self_intro',NULL,'B1',0,NULL,0.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,'你还没有开口说话，无法评估你的口语水平。再来一次试试吧！','completed','2026-06-26 14:29:37','2026-06-26 14:30:35','2026-06-26 14:29:37','2026-06-26 14:30:35'),(31,4,'1e292c29b643','self_intro',NULL,'B1',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','2026-06-26 14:33:23',NULL,'2026-06-26 14:33:23',NULL),(32,4,'b70b1af37a24','self_intro',NULL,'B1',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','2026-06-26 14:36:18',NULL,'2026-06-26 14:36:18',NULL),(33,4,'9875d5b9232d','self_intro',NULL,'B1',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','2026-06-26 14:36:35',NULL,'2026-06-26 14:36:35',NULL),(34,4,'64aa30ce751b','self_intro',NULL,'B1',0,NULL,